ve you  you get jobs earning some salaries  uplifting your standard and even  additional of education  to everything is important if not  education  i myself i cannot be a leader of my  community  she loves her work but is often rushed  off her feet  she has three children and also cares  for her sick husband  then she has two small shops that she  opened with loans  from the savings club thankfully her  eldest daughter is able to help out  habiba tadicha hopes her daughter will  follow in her footsteps  and she certainly seems to have  inherited her mother's passion for  leadership  she already leads the local youth group  you


